Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:05.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come along now, Alphonse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That must have hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:11.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll make it better right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.75,0:00:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember? Like I did \Nwhen you were a little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.37,0:00:29.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.23,0:01:37.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:48.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who obtain it are set free from the Law of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.03,0:01:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no need to pay a price \Nin order to obtain something, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We sought it and found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.63,0:03:45.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me try again, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:50.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al-kun, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:52.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:56.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your role in this is over, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:09.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You homunculus, get away from Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was taken in as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:35.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that isn't Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that too, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter whose form \Nshe may resemble,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.73,0:04:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that thing doesn't have a soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What an awful thing to say, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, Al-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker! You intentionally \Ncalled Al here by himself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:05:00.53,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,It's equivalent exchange. By using the Philosopher's Stone, this is what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:04.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were suckered \Ninto this by Tucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit, there's getting to be too many people I'm planning to whale on later,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.53,0:05:10.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and if I don't make notes or something of them all, I'm going to forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:13.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind. Right now, you're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.09,0:05:14.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He can't do that, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:17.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you going to \Nreturn Al back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or are you just going to let the whole rest of Al's body
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.69,0:05:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,be used up by this \N"you-know-who" person?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:41.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:42.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You stay out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:46.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hurt, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.53,0:05:50.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know it's going to take \Nmore than that for you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.42,0:05:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:08.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the transmutation circle
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.46,0:06:11.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that was drawn inside Dante-san's house when I defeated Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:14.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what seals up \Nyou homunculi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:19.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're smart, aren't you? \NBut this alone is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:23.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know. It also takes a \Nhomunculus' only weakness—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a portion of the \Nbody of the person
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.29,0:06:29.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who was the object of the attempt at resurrection by human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, what is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.22,0:06:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The object of the human transmutation that gave rise to this homunculus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:55.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you dug up Mom's grave \Nwithout telling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:06:57.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who \Nneeded to go through that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:02.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no use, Sloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:05.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doing that won't erase \Nthe transmutation circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:09.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I carved it deep with \Nthese nails, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:13.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:20.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like I did it \Nbecause I wanted that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:24.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why... would you betray the One?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:25.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sloth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.47,0:07:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,do you really not \Nremember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:31.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:35.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just a little bit, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.85,0:07:42.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason why \Nwe should have any memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:46.57,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,Maybe it's just that the thoughts of the person \Nwho performs human transmutation are so strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:50.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the memories of \Nthe deceased get burned in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, even so, \NI do have memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.59,0:07:56.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,an Ishbalan woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:03.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:09.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the memories of before you were born \Nwere ever to return to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:11.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Lust!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.22,0:08:14.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...then it will be you \Nthat gets a glimpse of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:22.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:27.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you can't use \NMom's body to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, if we don't kill them, \Nthey're going to be after you forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if you were able to stop her with that, then that's what that means, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:41.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's what was born back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:47.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, she's a homunculus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:50.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A homunculus is born during \Na failed human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:53.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if she doesn't have a soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.67,0:08:55.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:57.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who made her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right! That's why we have to bury her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:08:59.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:02.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, {\i1}I'll{\i0} do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go pick it up, Fullmetal boy. We can still seal her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:28.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were trying to \Npick on Mama using this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrath, she is not your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've decided to take everything of yours away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:38.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's not my mother either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:41.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:42.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:14.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to Mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:14.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:20.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's looking for a mother, \Nand he's found a substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop, I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.37,0:10:46.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.89,0:10:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will handle Wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:11.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a little old to be longing for mother's milk, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:33.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't do any good. I can keep coming back to life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:36.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As many times as you have red stones, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:38.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will kill you as many times...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as it takes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}to use them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.31,0:11:52.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:55.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,going to become him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.69,0:11:58.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would doing that make you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:00.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, for that matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:04.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what am I doing here at all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The whole thing was \Na mistake from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.45,0:12:18.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten? \NI can use alchemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.22,0:12:42.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't get free!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:13:00.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I touch him, there'll be a reaction, \Nand there's no telling what will happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, so it seems. So back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:04.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:09.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get it now, Al? She's not Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:10.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom wouldn't say something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:12.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't use you as a shield, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:16.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And she wouldn't hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:27.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't touch your brother, so you're trying to use a transmutation circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.61,0:13:29.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I won't give you \Nenough time to draw one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.59,0:13:31.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:32.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.05,0:13:34.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't this what you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:03.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanted to become human so you could die, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:21.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,wanted to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:38.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I become human...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:41.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,does it just mean death?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, what is it to be \Ncompletely human?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:54.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you answer me?! \NYou're a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:01.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.12,0:15:03.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:05.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to protect Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:09.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.41,0:15:12.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm, {\i1}I'm{\i0} the one who's sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, \Nwhere's Lust?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:21.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That night...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.89,0:15:24.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That night, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:28.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.91,0:15:43.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eat these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are his sons, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:58.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.78,0:16:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's starting to look a little more presentable, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:11.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You all used to \Nlook like that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.49,0:16:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There were children...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,two of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and yet very...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:39.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will understand \Nonce you become human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:43.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:45.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:48.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Find the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:52.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about I place her at your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is a vacant military registry \Nthat I used during the Ishbal incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She can slip in using that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:02.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. If you were to \Ntake her home with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:05.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your adorable wife would become jealous, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sloth...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:10.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As of today,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.69,0:17:12.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you are Sloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:18.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is she vibrating her cells and generating heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:29.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop pretending to be Mom! \NYou don't even have any of her memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:35.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}do{\i0} have memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like Lust said,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:45.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,maybe the thoughts of your mother \Nwithin you were just burned into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:47.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're lying! If that were so, \Nyou wouldn't be able to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}why{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:50.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm able to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:56.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do have memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:18:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Memories of myself as your mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:02.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:04.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your mother is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:06.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:13.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:16.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:21.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By doing so, I can prove \Nthat I am not your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you were no longer here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:27.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be tormented by these memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:30.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am not your mother, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:32.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel I {\i1}am{\i0} your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:35.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I almost feel as though \NI could love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:38.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You created me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:19:00.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, what should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:03.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the form \Nour sin has taken on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am not your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:32.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no intention \Nof holding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.24,0:19:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:48.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I transmuted my Automail into sodium.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It explodes when it \Nreacts with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.95,0:19:58.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:19:58.91,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.91,0:20:00.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She wasn't anyone's mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your mama is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:04.34,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:06.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.05,0:20:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.81,0:20:17.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:18.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:20.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:20.60,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Stay back, Wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama, I'm going to \Nbecome one with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:40.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He fused himself with another homunculus?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.31,0:20:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrath...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.53,0:20:44.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He took the portion of my mom \NI brought with me inside his own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:21:01.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With it that close to you, \Nyou can't move, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:04.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to reconstruct \Nall of the material
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:06.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're composed of \Ninto another material.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not possible, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't transmute a person's body!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.09,0:21:13.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I realized something \Nduring my fight with Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:18.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I rearranged the elements he was composed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.49,0:21:20.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like what Kimbly did,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.44,0:21:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,when he restructured the \Nelements in just one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:25.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to restructure \Nthe entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The reason being \Nthat a homunculus...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.57,0:21:31.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is not human!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.19,0:21:42.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you do to Mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:44.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:45.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get away from her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.85,0:21:47.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I restructured your water into ethanol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.61,0:21:55.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It vaporizes at room temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:40.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.31,0:23:43.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 48: "Good-bye"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.23,0:23:47.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom... Colonel... Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the path I have chosen.
